      "content": "I'll read both the original test and the CUT source to understand the code before improving it.Now I understand what the test does. Value 130 falls in the \"Run codec\" range (117–140), which forces a read from the input stream to decode `kb`. Since the `PipedInputStream` is not connected to any `PipedOutputStream`, reading from it throws `IOException(\"Pipe not connected\")`. Let me write a more understandable version.The improved test compiled successfully."
